OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers 'horrified' by proposed
OL,4,Agiant solar farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in a village close to a
OL,7,Fproposed new solar farm say they are
OL,8,F"horrified" by the plans.
OL,10,FSolar farm company Low Carbon wants to
OL,11,Fbuild the huge development on land
OL,12,Faround Mark, in Somerset, to help the
OL,13,FUK meet its target of being net zero by
OL,14,F2050. It says the project would provide
OL,15,Felectricity for more than 140,000
OL,16,Fhomes.
OL,18,FBut locals in Mark, a village with a
OL,19,Fpopulation of about 700 people, say the
OL,20,Fsolar farm is "too large" and the road
OL,21,Finfrastructure is "not up to scratch".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
