OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers 'horrified' by proposed
OL,4,Agiant solar farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FEd Perrin, development director at Low
OL,7,FCarbon, said the project is at an
OL,8,F"early stage" and wants "local
OL,9,Fknowledge to help shape their plans"
OL,10,Fahead of a public consultation next
OL,11,Fspring.
